  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  NpcSays:
  - Hello How Are you
  - "You see, we\u2019ve had reports of strange creatures roaming the outskirts of
    the city. They\u2019re causing quite a bit of trouble, and we could use someone
    brave enough to take care of them."
  - "I believe you have what it takes, don\u2019t you? The townsfolk could really
    use some help. If you\u2019re up for the challenge\u2026 I have a quest for you."
